rom npm\n\n0.1.0 is published, with provenance, so the vendored tarballs, the\noverride for @edity/astro's dependency on core and the Dockerfile step that\ncopied them go. @edity/* is exempt from the three-day minimumReleaseAge,\nwhich would refuse a day-old release, so the sandbox can try each Edity\nrelease as soon as it is out. The built page and the Editor bundle are\nbyte-identical to the vendored build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6de6fef71b09bf0b4dd6ae8f0da12a43b7ae02a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/git/trees/6de6fef71b09bf0b4dd6ae8f0da12a43b7ae02a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/git/commits/7b2ba675cfb202e9860bae12a70ace8bf6ba2d44","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/commits/7b2ba675cfb202e9860bae12a70ace8bf6ba2d44","html_url":"https://github.com/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/commit/7b2ba675cfb202e9860bae12a70ace8bf6ba2d44","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/commits/7b2ba675cfb202e9860bae12a70ace8bf6ba2d44/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"0345f674a02fb499b9e8e1a9cfc4b788db1549e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/commits/0345f674a02fb499b9e8e1a9cfc4b788db1549e6","html_url":"https://github.com/RMYPG/edity-sandbox/commit/0345f674a02fb499b9e8e1a9cfc4b788db1549e6"}]},{"sha":"0345f674a02fb499b9e8e1a9cfc4b788db1549e6","node_id":"C_kwDOVWyoCNoAKDAzNDVmNjc0YTAyZmI0OTliOWU4ZTFhOWNmYzRiNzg4ZGIxNTQ5ZTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mario Rojas Padrón","email":"74364145+MarioRP-01@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-26T22:50:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-10-26T22:50:51Z"},"message":"Home page and its Migration to JSON, with the Editor (edity tickets 04 and 05) (#2)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@an